{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】將軍澳昭信路爆鹹水管。</p>\n<p>鹹水湧出路面，車輛經過要慢駛。</p>\n<p>立法會議員方國珊表示，下午約六時許接獲居民反映昭信路爆鹹水管，鹹水湧出馬路及附近單車徑，有關路段暫時封路，附近交通較為擠塞，她已通知水務署關閉水掣。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T12:43:54.860631+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T12:18:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:27.411272+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T12:37:27.411272+00:00","content_hash":"c289c05a92c5e6a576245b56a8c8c9f9b08c567353ef2c9cb3f5eaf5a1d1f82f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}